  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSD013N South Sudan COVID JR 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to mitigate the impact of Covid-19 pandemic among vulnerable people residing in the Protection of Civilians site in Bentiu/Rubkona county (Unity). The intervention combines health interventions with protection against SGBV and Covid-19. Health facilities will be will be improved with hygiene stations, triage points and waste disposal facilities. Primary Health Care consultations will be geared up to reduce co-morbidity and ensure continuity of care. Women and Girls Friendly spaces will be supported with psycho-social support, GBV referral and staff will be trained on adequate response.</narrative>
  </description>
